      <h2>Contact Us</h2>
      <p>Questions about these Terms? Contact us at:</p>
      <p>
        <strong>Inscio</strong><br />
        5830 Granite Pkwy Suite 100<br />
        Plano, TX 75024<br />
        <a href="mailto:brian@inscio.com">brian@inscio.com</a>
      </p>

    </div>
